---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "Best Mutual Fund Portfolio Tracker India | Import Investments Instantly",
  description: "The best mutual fund portfolio tracker in India. Simply import your investment statement to get real-time tracking, XIRR analysis, and consolidate your wealth.",
};
---
<Layout title={seo.title} description={seo.description} keywords="mutual fund portfolio tracker, value research portfolio tracker, google finance portfolio tracker, track mutual funds and stocks, how to track mutual funds in real time, best apps for tracking stocks and mutual funds" schema={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [{
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How to track mutual funds in real time?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "The fastest way to track mutual funds in real-time is to import your investment statement (CAS — Consolidated Account Statement) into a dedicated portfolio tracker. You bypass broker delays and get instant end-of-day NAV updates."
        }
      }, {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can I track mutual funds and stocks together?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes, the best apps for tracking stocks and mutual funds allow you to manage a unified dashboard. Arthavi allows you to import your investment statement and manually add NSE/BSE stocks alongside them."
        }
      }, {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Arthavi vs Value Research or Google Finance?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "While a Google Finance portfolio tracker is good for basic manual entry, it relies heavily on spreadsheet skills. Arthavi automates XIRR math directly from your imported investment statement without building clunky templates."
        }
      }]
    })}>

    

    <main class="container">
        <section class="page-header fade-in">
            <h1>Mutual Fund Portfolio Tracker for India</h1>
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 1.25rem; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
                The most private way to track your mutual funds. Upload your investment statement (CAS) — a file you can download from your mutual fund provider — and get instant analytics.
            </p>
            <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/register" class="btn btn-primary">Create Free Account</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <article class="prose fade-in delay-100">
            <h2>Why Use a Dedicated Mutual Fund Tracker?</h2>
            <p>If you have ever searched for the <strong>best apps for tracking stocks and mutual funds</strong>, you know the struggle. Broker apps only show you the funds you bought through them. If you have moved from Regular to Direct
                plans, or switched brokers (e.g., Zerodha to Groww), your data is heavily fragmented.</p>
            <p>Arthavi serves as a central <strong>mutual fund portfolio tracker</strong> for India, accepting your investment statement (CAS — Consolidated Account Statement) from CAMS and KFintech.</p>

            <h3>How to track mutual funds in real time</h3>
            <p>Many investors wonder <strong>how to track mutual funds in real time</strong> without waiting for monthly broker emails. By importing your CAS directly, our system continuously fetches the latest Net Asset Values (NAVs) at the end of every trading day. You never have to manually update prices again.</p>

            <h2>Alternatives on the Market</h2>
            <p>You might be currently using a <strong>google finance portfolio tracker</strong> spreadsheet or a <strong>value research portfolio tracker</strong>. The issue with spreadsheets is that manual entry for SIPs breaks down after 3-5 years (try inputting 60 different transaction dates manually!). The issue with older platforms is often outdated user interfaces or paywalls for basic XIRR features.</p>
            <p>Arthavi is built to be modern, incredibly fast, and 100% free for core tracking functionality.</p>

            <h2>Privacy-First Approach</h2>
            <p>Many "free" CAS analyzers upload your statement to third-party servers to scrape email addresses, analyze your expenses, or sell
                leads. Arthavi processes data securely. We don't read your emails. We don't sell data. We are entirely ad-free.</p>

            <div style="margin-top: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                <h3>Get a consolidated view of your wealth</h3>
                <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/register" class="btn btn-primary">Create Free Account</a>
            </div>
        </article>
    </main>

    
    

</Layout>
